      "kind": "slide",
      "stage": "goal",
      "layout": "text",
      "html": "<div class=\"s-text\"><div class=\"s-stage\">Постановка цели</div><div class=\"s-num\">Загадка</div><h2>Отгадай!</h2><p class=\"s-big\">Разноцветное коромысло<br>над рекой повисло</p></div><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"fig-svg\"><path d=\"M70 290 A250 250 0 0 1 570 290\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d5d9df\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M92 290 A228 228 0 0 1 548 290\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d5d9df\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M114 290 A206 206 0 0 1 526 290\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d5d9df\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M136 290 A184 184 0 0 1 504 290\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d5d9df\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M158 290 A162 162 0 0 1 482 290\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d5d9df\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M180 290 A140 140 0 0 1 460 290\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d5d9df\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M202 290 A118 118 0 0 1 438 290\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d5d9df\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><text x=\"320\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"170\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#ff6a00\" text-anchor=\"middle\">?</text></svg></div>"
