      "html": "<div class=\"s-text\"><div class=\"s-stage\">Практическая часть</div><div class=\"s-num\">Шаг 1</div><span class=\"stars\" title=\"уровень 1\">★</span><h2>Открой Paint: щёлк-щёлк по значку</h2><p class=\"s-hint\">Значок с палитрой на рабочем столе</p></div><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 420\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"fig-svg\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"638\" height=\"418\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"url(#dsk)\"></rect><g><rect x=\"34\" y=\"34\" width=\"44\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#dfe6ee\" stroke=\"#9aa6b2\"></rect><rect x=\"30\" y=\"28\" width=\"52\" height=\"8\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#c3ccd6\"></rect><text x=\"56\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Корзина</text></g><g transform=\"translate(26 130) scale(1.0)\"><path d=\"M30 4 C12 4 2 16 2 30 C2 46 16 56 30 56 C36 56 38 52 36 48 C34 44 36 40 42 40 L48 40 C55 40 58 35 58 28 C58 14 46 4 30 4 Z\" fill=\"#f6e2bd\" stroke=\"#a57a3e\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"22\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#e53935\"></circle><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"14\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#fdd835\"></circle><circle cx=\"43\" cy=\"20\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#1e63d6\"></circle><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"38\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#43a047\"></circle><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"44\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#a57a3e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle></g><text x=\"56\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Paint</text><g><path d=\"M28 240 L50 240 L56 248 L86 248 L86 282 L28 282 Z\" fill=\"#ffd54f\" stroke=\"#c79a00\"></path><text x=\"56\" y=\"302\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Мои рисунки</text></g><rect x=\"1\" y=\"378\" width=\"638\" height=\"41\" fill=\"#1d2633\" opacity=\"0.92\"></rect><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"398\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.85\"></circle><path d=\"M300 388 L316 388 L320 393 L336 393 L336 410 L300 410 Z\" fill=\"#ffd54f\"></path><g transform=\"translate(350 383) scale(0.5)\"><path d=\"M30 4 C12 4 2 16