      "html": "<div class=\"s-text\"><div class=\"s-stage\">Практическая часть</div><div class=\"s-num\">Шаг 2</div><span class=\"stars\" title=\"уровень 1\">★</span><h2>Белый лист — это холст. Рисуем на нём</h2></div><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1190 725\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"fig-svg shot\"><image x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1190\" height=\"725\" href=\"/content/1-klass-2-chetvert/media/0c1fd7078665037c.webp\"></image><rect x=\"289\" y=\"203\" width=\"878\" height=\"496\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6a00\" stroke-width=\"5.5\" class=\"hl\"></rect><rect x=\"680.0\" y=\"429\" width=\"96.0\" height=\"42\" rx=\"21\" fill=\"#ff6a00\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></rect><text x=\"728\" y=\"457.5\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Холст</text></svg></div>"
